{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c6281638-a22c-8e28-9c73-b00e1de862aa",
  "created_at": "2026-02-17T16:01:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:58:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:58:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, yeah, I'm calling about a utility pole that's leaning. A car hit it, I [inaudible] think over the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:58:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, you broke up a little there. A car hit a pole and now it's leaning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:59:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, exactly. Somebody clipped it and it's got a good tilt to it now. It's got the streetlight on top, so I figure it's one of yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, let me write that down. Pole struck by a vehicle, leaning, streetlight on it. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:59:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 89 Coggeshall Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "89 Coggeshall Avenue. Is the light still working, or is it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] it's still on, far as I can tell. It came on last night. But the pole's definitely off plumb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:59:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, light still on. Sorry, I lost you for a second on that last part. Did you say the wires look okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:59:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I didn't say, but no, I don't see anything hanging down or sparking or anything like that. Just the lean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Is it leaning toward the road or toward the houses?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:00:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Toward the sidewalk side, a little bit toward the houses. Not over the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, toward the sidewalk. And did you see the car, or is that just what you figure happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:00:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just figure. There's some broken plastic and glass at the base, and a scrape on the pole. Heard something Saturday night but didn't look out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:00:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Makes sense. I'll put in a request for a crew to go look at it and see whether it's stable. Can I get a name and a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Jorge Furtado. Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Jorge Furtado, four oh one, five five five, oh one seven eight. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:00:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:00:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Now, if it's a utility pole with the light on it, a crew will check it and sort out who owns what. You're not far from the old base, right, down toward the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:01:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A bit, yeah. I used to work at the old naval station, actually. Still miss it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:01:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A lot of people around here say that. Well, that's down in the notes, Jorge. Somebody should be out in the next few days to take a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if it gets worse before then, should I call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:01:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call right back, and if you see wires down or it looks like it's about to fall, keep clear of it and call 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:01:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. I'll keep an eye on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:01:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling it in. Have a good evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T16:01:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kevin. You too."
    }
  ],
